{
  cli: {
    banner: {
      taglineMode: "off", // random | default | off
    },
  },
}
```

- `cli.banner.taglineMode` controls banner tagline style:
  - `"random"` (default): rotating funny/seasonal taglines.
  - `"default"`: fixed neutral tagline (`All your chats, one OpenClaw.`).
